 "counterevidence": "Both sides are approximations: capex includes non-AI spend and the revenue side double-counts enterprise purchases from labs; a ratio of filed capex to press-reported run-rates is the brief's own 'gap #1' caveat. Part of the ratio's fall is a step when Menlo's 2025 survey wave raised the enterprise-spend denominator, not a change in capex.",
 "crosswalk": [],
